    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d569">

                <pb facs="0986" n="890" sameAs="frus:frus1926v02/pg890"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">853.51/315: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Portugal</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Dearing</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-02-03T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 3,
                                1926—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>5. Department’s No. 4, January 23, 4 p.m. Unless you are aware that Portuguese
                    Government is actually preparing appropriate decree <pb facs="0987" n="891"
                        xml:id="pg891"/> for promulgation at early date, Department suggests that
                    you consider advisability of taking action as outlined in Department’s No. 85,
                    November 17, 4 [<hi rendition="#italic">7</hi>] p.m.,<anchor n="15"
                        xml:id="d569-f1"/> and its No. 1, January 8, 9 p.m. Please cable how matters
                    stand and your recommendations.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
